# Example production environment variables for Vercel
#
# In Vercel Dashboard:
# 1. Go to Project Settings > Environment Variables
# 2. Add this variable (without the VITE_ prefix):
#
# GOLEMIO_API_KEY=your_actual_token_here
#
# The serverless functions in /api will use this to authenticate with Golemio API
#
# Note: Do NOT prefix with VITE_ in Vercel - the serverless functions access
# process.env.GOLEMIO_API_KEY directly, not import.meta.env
#
# Map tiles: CARTO raster basemaps need a key (free at https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey).
# This one DOES use the VITE_ prefix - it is baked into the client bundle at build
# time, so redeploy after adding it:
#
# VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=your_carto_key_here
